     A**
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PMI01                     TEXT('BILL ENTRY MESSAGE ID FILE')
     A            MIMSG#    R               REFFLD(MSG#)
     A*                      Note: For state fee schedule messages,
     A*                            the state designations will be the
     A*                            first 2 positions of this field.
     A*
     A            MIMSEQ    R               REFFLD(A30)
     A*                      Note: Sequence number 0 is used for the
     A*                            short '1st level' description.
     A*                            Sequence numbers 1 - 5 are used for
     A*                            the extended '2nd level' description
     A*
     A            MITYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A*                      Note: Valid values are contained in the
     A*                            generic table (FTGTP) under the
     A*                            'ERMG' ID entry.
     A*
     A            MIDESC    R               REFFLD(DS70)
     A            MISTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            MIUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT USER')
     A            MIPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT PROGRAM')
     A            MITIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT TIME')
     A            MIDT      R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT DATE')
     A            MIIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL USER')
     A            MIIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL PROGRAM')
     A            MIITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL TIME')
     A            MIIDT     R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL DATE')
     A*** BEG ADD *** 04/25/02 ****************************************
     A            MICRST    R               REFFLD(CODE3)
     A                                      COLHDG('CODEREVIEW' 'STATUS')
     A*                        VALID VALUES:
     A*                              FROM GENERIC TABLE ID: CRST
     A            MICRET    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('CODEREVIEW' 'EDIT TYPE')
     A*                        VALID VALUES:
     A*                              FROM GENERIC TABLE ID: CRET
     A*** END ADD *** 04/25/02 ****************************************
     A*** BEG ADD *** 06/11/12 ****************************************
     A            MICKPS    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
     A                                      'Payment Status')
     A*
     A            MICKET    R               REFFLD(DS3)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
     A                                      'Edit Type')
     A*
