     A*
     A            MICKHA    R               REFFLD(DS7)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
     A                                      'History Action')
     A*
     A            MICKE1    R               REFFLD(DS2)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
     A                                      'SCE Error1')
     A*
     A            MICKE2    R               REFFLD(DS2)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
