     A*
     A            MICKDM    R               REFFLD(DS2)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
     A                                      'Duplicate Message' +
     A                                      'Type')
     A*
     A            MICKDF    R               REFFLD(DS2)
     A                                      COLHDG('ClaimCheck' +
